@startuml seq-image
!include _style.iuml
skinparam maxMessageSize 90
autonumber
actor 用户
participant "AttachmentEditor" as AE
participant "系统相册选择器\n/ 剪贴板" as PK
participant "SaverViewModel" as VM
participant "AttachmentStore" as AS
participant "ContentResolver" as CR
用户 -> AE : 从相册选择 / 粘贴图片
AE -> PK : PickMultipleVisualMedia
PK --> AE : content:// URI 列表
AE -> VM : importImages(session, uris)
VM -> AS : importImages(uris)（IO 线程，互斥锁）
loop 每张图片
  AS -> CR : openInputStream(uri)
  AS -> AS : 流式写入 .part 临时文件（> 20 MiB 拒绝）
  AS -> AS : 读取尺寸并解码缩略样本，验证是真图片
  AS -> AS : 改名为 <uuid>.img 私有副本
end
alt 任一失败
  AS -> AS : rollback：删除本次已创建的文件
  AS --> VM : AttachmentException（中文错误提示）
else 全部成功
  AS --> VM : List<AttachmentRef>
end
VM --> AE : ImageImportResult → 草稿中显示缩略图
note over VM, AS
  保存成功前副本只属于草稿；取消或移除时
  按数据库引用清理，24 小时孤儿文件兜底回收。
end note
@enduml
